        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.88,
        "statement": "(the \"Company\" or \"Viemed\"), through its subsidiaries, is a provider of home medical equipment (\"HME\") and post-acute healthcare services in the United States, with a focus on respiratory, chronic care, and women’s health products and services.",
